{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the touching story of Kebab, a rural cat, as she copes with grief following her passing from old age. Delve into her world and discover the story of her life, from her adoption by a loving family to the meaningful recollections that shaped her being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rest In Paws&quot; presents an emotive third-person platformer, challenging players to navigate through diverse environments employing logic and mechanical skill to progress. Uncover memories scattered throughout the game, essential for understanding Kebab's life journey and ultimately finding solace in the face of loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706450/extras/2f8c815dce626724bfb8fea3e5b16436.avif?t=1767720225\" width=680 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706450/extras/419149cf13dcaa60ab251f42fb83f4da.avif?t=1767720225\" width=774 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCOVER THE WORLD:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse various environments that reflect the five stages of grief, each intricately tied to Kebab's life experiences. From her cozy home to a chilling frozen cave, journey through places significant to her story, witnessing firsthand the impact of grief on her reality. Master platforming mechanics and utilize environmental elements, such as interacting with buttons, rotating objects, and pushing boxes, to navigate through the platforming zones of each level and overcome the most challenging obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706450/extras/50b4ba8a16e81087d1a22d27ae6b5d65.avif?t=1767720225\" width=674 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706450/extras/419149cf13dcaa60ab251f42fb83f4da.avif?t=1767720225\" width=774 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EMOTIONAL STORY:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Immerse yourself in an emotional tale as you guide the ghost of Kebab through the landscapes of her past, helping her come to terms with grief and find peace in the afterlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706450/extras/fc2cc535bf3bd2dbdfc8016908299ab8.avif?t=1767720225\" width=682 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706450/extras/419149cf13dcaa60ab251f42fb83f4da.avif?t=1767720225\" width=774 height=258 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706450?t=1767720225","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706450/d02b98e5bf161365d1bc32f7a814818d408cff07/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767720225","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706450/54af16170394a23ad69c30ad3d5075b8006df4ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767720225","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706450/54af16170394a23ad69c30ad3d5075b8006df4ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767720225","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id"